cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StatsCapybara in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "StatsCapybara: a free, interactive statistics course for visual learners"
abstract: >-
  An open, browser-based statistics curriculum of 102 interactive lessons
  across eight courses in two tracks, alongside 21 tool pages, five long-form
  guides, 71 worked practice problems and nine reproducible practice datasets.
  Every lesson pairs a written explanation with a canvas visualization the
  reader can manipulate. The site is a dependency-free static build; its
  statistical routines are gated by a regression suite of 1,087 assertions,
  each citing the published source it is checked against.
type: software
